 and covered [it] with a cloth. {image: Heb. teraphim}"],"ref":"I Samuel 19:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"And Michal","strong":"H4324"},{"text":" took","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" an image","strong":"H8655"},{"text":", and laid","strong":"H7760"},{"text":" [it] in the bed","strong":"H4296"},{"text":", and put","strong":"H7760"},{"text":" a pillow","strong":"H3523"},{"text":" of goats","strong":"H5795"},{"text":"' [hair] for his bolster","strong":"H4763"},{"text":", and covered","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" [it] with a cloth","strong":"H899"},{"text":". {image: Heb. teraphim}"}]},{"id":7720,"title":"I Samuel 19:14","segments":["And when Saul sent messengers to take David, she said, He [is] sick."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"And when Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" to take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":", she said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", He [is] sick","strong":"H2470"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7721,"title":"I Samuel 19:15","segments":["And Saul sent the messengers [again] to see David, saying, Bring him up to me in the bed, that I may slay him."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"And Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" the messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" [again] to see","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Bring him up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" to me in the bed","strong":"H4296"},{"text":", that I may slay","strong":"H4191"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":7722,"title":"I Samuel 19:16","segments":["And when the messengers were come in, behold, [there was] an image in the bed, with a pillow of goats' [hair] for his bolster."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"And when the messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" were come in","strong":"H935"},{"text":", behold, [there was] an image","strong":"H8655"},{"t