":"H5046"},{"text":" Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Behold, David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" [is] at Naioth","strong":"H5121"},{"text":" in Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7726,"title":"I Samuel 19:20","segments":["And Saul sent messengers to take David: and when they saw the company of the prophets prophesying, and Samuel standing [as] appointed over them, the Spirit of God was upon the messengers of Saul, and they also prophesied."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"And Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" to take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":": and when they saw","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" the company","strong":"H3862"},{"text":" of the prophets","strong":"H5030"},{"text":" prophesying","strong":"H5012"},{"text":", and Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":" standing","strong":"H5975"},{"text":" [as] appointed","strong":"H5324"},{"text":" over them, the Spirit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":" of God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" was upon the messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" of Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":", and they also prophesied","strong":"H5012"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7727,"title":"I Samuel 19:21","segments":["And when it was told Saul, he sent other messengers, and they prophesied likewise. And Saul sent messengers again the third time, and they prophesied also."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"And when it was told","strong":"H5046"},{"text":" Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":", he sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" other","strong":"H312"},{"text":" messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":", and they prophesied","strong":"H5012"},{"text":" likewise. And Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" messengers","strong":"H4397"},{"text":" again","strong":"H3254"},{"text":" the third","strong":"H7992"},{"text":" time, and they prophesied","strong":"H5012"},{"text":" also."}]},{"id":7728,"title":"I Samuel 19:22","segments":["Then went he also to Ramah, and came to a great well that [is] in Sechu: and he asked and said, Where [are] Samuel and David? And [one] said, Behold, [they be] at Naioth in Ramah."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"Then went","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" he also to Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":", and came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to a great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" well","strong":"H953"},{"text":" that [is] in Sechu","strong":"H7906"},{"text":": and he asked","strong":"H7592"},{"text":" and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Where","strong":"H375"},{"text":" [are] Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":" and David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":"? And [one] said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Behold, [they be] at Naioth","strong":"H5121"},{"text":" in Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7729,"title":"I Samuel 19:23","segments":["And he went thither to Naioth in Ramah: and the Spirit of God was upon him also, and he went on, and prophesied, until he came to Naioth in Ramah."],"ref":"I Samuel 19:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"And he went","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" thither to Naioth","strong":"H5121"},{"text":" in Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":": and the Spirit","strong":"H7307"},{"text":" of God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" was upon him also, and he went","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" on","strong":"H1980"},{"text":", and prophesied","strong":"H5012"},{"text":", until he came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Naioth","strong":"H5121"},{"text":" in Ramah","strong":"H7414"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7730,"title":"I Samuel 19:24","segments":["And he stripped off his clothes also, and prophesied before Samuel in like manner, and lay down naked all that day and all that night. Wherefore they say, [Is] Saul also among the prophets? {lay: Heb. fell}"],"ref":"I Samuel 19:24","verse":24,"words":[{"text":"And he stripped off","strong":"H6584"},{"text":" his clothes","strong":"H